    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on Life's Greatest Tiny Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of us made it. We triumphed against hundreds of millions of other swimmers to reach the egg and create life. We just don't remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience life's grand journey as one of millions of sperm. Survive the fantastical journey through the microcosm of the reproductive system and create new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BeCum: A Sperm's Journey is a single-player, third-person action-adventure game at a microscopic scale made in Unreal 5.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of sperm will you be? Team up with other Sperm to overcome obstacles, distract antibodies, push through thick slime or get inside the egg.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flow with or hide from currents. Gather energy and proteins to become faster, more resilient, or efficient. Specialize through hormones. Survive harsh conditions like deadly acidic areas, thick mucus, antibodies chasing you, and other surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against 300 million others to reach the egg first and create new life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on Life's Greatest Tiny Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of us made it. We triumphed against hundreds of millions of other swimmers to reach the egg and create life. We just don't remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience life's grand journey as one of millions of sperm. Survive the fantastical journey through the microcosm of the reproductive system and create new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BeCum: A Sperm's Journey is a single-player, third-person action-adventure game at a microscopic scale made in Unreal 5.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of sperm will you be? Team up with other Sperm to overcome obstacles, distract antibodies, push through thick slime or get inside the egg.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flow with or hide from currents. Gather energy and proteins to become faster, more resilient, or efficient. Specialize through hormones. Survive harsh conditions like deadly acidic areas, thick mucus, antibodies chasing you, and other surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against 300 million others to reach the egg first and create new life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "Experience life's fantastical journey as one of millions of sperm. Survive the microcosm dangers, wiggle, dash and compete through the human reproductive system and create new life.",
